sidebar.png

# Agent worktrees are full checkouts of this repo; never commit them into it.
.claude/worktrees/

# Page snapshots and screenshots the Playwright MCP tools drop beside whatever
# directory they were driven from. Verifying a UI change writes a dozen of them,
# and they are worth exactly as much as the run that made them.
.playwright-mcp/

# Personal overrides of the commands this project declares. The shared file
# beside it is checked in; this one is yours, and the app says so out loud if
# this line ever goes missing.
.tgxcode/commands.local.json

# The same deal for settings. The Settings panel offers a "Project — local"
# scope whose entire premise is that this file is yours and not the
# repository's — and bridge/prefs.js has called it "the gitignored local file"
# since before anything ignored it. Now something does.
.tgxcode/settings.local.json
